{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNuE2zlZaKRBeYuSgCAo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FCnWpF1ytfKUZFG3CDrKtY","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"N5enrxo4N7aBzKhkTSXpzU","description":"Read all text content on brief page 00","code":"\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '0:1');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst out = [];\nfunction walk(n, depth){\n  if (n.type === 'TEXT') out.push({i:n.id, n:n.name, t:n.characters, fs:n.fontSize, f:n.fontName, w:n.absoluteBoundingBox&&n.absoluteBoundingBox.width});\n  if ('children' in n) for (const c of n.children) walk(c, depth+1);\n}\nfor (const c of page.children) walk(c,0);\nreturn JSON.stringify(out, null, 1);\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":10160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":594}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"0101c3de-b887-4b95-82a4-64d389707c57","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:12:59.711Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FCnWpF1ytfKUZFG3CDrKtY","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LHNO5CUkvXMdWbHC620jPk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3286\">\n    <frame id=\"3:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"3:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"3:5\" name=\"MAC — digital marketing agency landing page\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"3:6\" name=\"Design the landing page of a digital marketing agency: introduce the agency, prove results, show case studies, answer common questions and invite visitors to get in touch. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"3:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 1 frame below, named exactly as listed. It is a single landing page, so there is no prototype to wire. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. The source has no photography: case-study thumbnails, the video poster and the avatars are image placeholders — keep them as placeholders. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1045\">\n      <text id=\"3:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"956\">\n        <frame id=\"3:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"956\">\n          <text id=\"3:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"3:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand what the agency does, trust it, and get in touch.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:18\" name=\"• About: “Provide the best service with out-of-the-box ideas” · “We are a passionate team of digital marketing enthusiasts dedicated to helping businesses succeed in the digital world. With years of experience and a deep understanding of the ever-evolving online landscape, we stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies.” • Blog: “Digital Marketing &amp; SEO Services That Grow Traffic &amp; Increase Revenue” · “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings and drive more traffic to their websites.” · “See more” · 3 article cards, each with “5 min read”, title, excerpt and open (Icon_Arrow_Right) (see DATA) • Call to action: “Ready to work with us?” · “Get Started” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Case studies: “Real-world examples of how we have helped companies achieve their marketing objectives.” · filters All Work [20] · UI/UX Design [10] · Digital Marketing [5] · Branding [5] · current filter: UI/UX Design · 3 case-study cards with image placeholders (see DATA) · the first card is shown in its hover state with “See Details” • FAQ: “Digital Marketing FAQs” · “As a leading digital marketing agency, we are dedicated to providing comprehensive educational resources and answering frequently asked questions to help our clients.” · “More Questions” · “Contact Us” · 4 questions (see DATA) · the first question is expanded with its answer, the other three are collapsed (Icon_Minus / Icon_Plus) • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: Logo_MAC · navigation Service · Agency · Case Study · Resources (each with a dropdown, Icon_Chevron_Down) · Contact · “Get started” · notifications (Icon_Bell) • Hero stats: “230+” · “some big companies that we work with, and trust us very much” · progress bar (no value given) · growth badge (Icon_Trending_Up) · traffic card “Drive More Traffic and Sales” · “Drive more traffic and product sales” · 3-bar rising chart (no values given) • Hero: “Stay ahead of the curve with our forward-thinking” · “An award-winning SEO agency with disciplines in digital marketing, design, and website development, focused on understanding you.” · “Schedule Call” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · “View Case Study” • Projects &amp; video: “920+” · “Projects finished superbly” · 4 avatar placeholders and “+” · video placeholder “HOW WE WORK” · play (Icon_Play) • Testimonial: “They thoroughly analyze our industry and target audience, allowing them to develop customized campaigns that effectively reach and engage our customers. Their creative ideas and cutting-edge techniques have helped us stay ahead of the competition.” · avatar placeholder · Michael Kaizer · CEO of Campfield Corp · pager “01/05” · previous / next (Icon_Arrow_Left, Icon_Arrow_Right) • Trusted by: “Trusted by the world’s biggest brands” · 3 client wordmarks set as text: Paywise · Campfield · Mazeline\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"760\" />\n          <text id=\"3:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"886\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"3:20\" name=\"Single-page task: no links between frames. Every button and link is entry only.\" x=\"24\" y=\"912\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:21\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1647\" width=\"1312\" height=\"117\">\n      <text id=\"3:22\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:23\" name=\"• One frame. The header and footer are part of it. • Entry only (no frame): header menu items and their dropdowns, Get started, notifications, Schedule Call, View Case Study, play video, filters, See Details, case-study cards, testimonial pager, More Questions, Contact Us, FAQ questions (expand / collapse is a state on the same frame), See more, article cards, Get Started, footer links, social logos.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"66\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:24\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1812\" width=\"1312\" height=\"743\">\n      <text id=\"3:25\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:26\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:27\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"654\">\n        <frame id=\"3:28\" name=\"Case-study cards (in order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"3:29\" name=\"Case-study cards (in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:30\" name=\"1 · hover state: image placeholder with “See Details” (no caption shown) 2 · “Ai Corporation. 2023” — “Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App” 3 · “Lancer Corporation. 2023” — “App Lancer - Freelance Mobile App”\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:31\" name=\"FAQ (in order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"315\">\n          <text id=\"3:32\" name=\"FAQ (in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:33\" name=\"Why is digital marketing important for my business? — expanded: “Digital marketing allows businesses to reach and engage with a wider audience, generate leads, drive website traffic, and increase brand visibility. It provides measurable results, allows for targeted marketing efforts, and enables businesses to adapt and optimize their strategies based on data and insights.” How can digital marketing help improve my website’s visibility? How long does it take to see results from digital marketing efforts? How do you measure the success of digital marketing campaigns?\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"247\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:34\" name=\"Articles (in order; all “5 min read”)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"3:35\" name=\"Articles (in order; all “5 min read”)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"232\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:36\" name=\"How a Digital Marketing Agency Can Boost Your Business — “We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings.” The Latest Trends and Strategies with a Digital Marketing Agency — “Working with this digital marketing agency has been a true partnership. They have taken the time to understand our business and industry.” Maximizing ROI with the Expertise of a Digital Marketing Agency — “What sets this digital marketing agency apart is their commitment to transparency and collaboration. They keep us informed every step of the way.”\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"228\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:37\" name=\"Footer\" x=\"0\" y=\"339\" width=\"420\" height=\"315\">\n          <text id=\"3:38\" name=\"Footer\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"45\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"3:39\" name=\"Logo_MAC · “We offer a comprehensive suite of digital marketing services that cover all aspects of your online presence. From SEO and social media marketing to content creation and PPC advertising, we have the expertise and resources to handle your diverse marketing needs.” Social: Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_LinkedIn · Logo_Instagram Navigation: Service · Agency · Case Study · Resources · Contact Licence: Privacy Policy · Copyright · Email Address Contact: (406) 555-0120 (Icon_Phone) · hey@example.com (Icon_Mail) · 2972 Westheimer Rd. Santa Ana, Illinois 85486 (Icon_Map_Pin)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"247\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:40\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2603\" width=\"1312\" height=\"312\">\n      <text id=\"3:41\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:42\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"261\">\n        <frame id=\"3:43\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"201\">\n          <text id=\"3:44\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"3:45\" name=\"• Frame name • Must-include content (what, not how) • All data and copy • Brand colors #99EA48 and #010205, and Plus Jakarta Sans • Media: logo, social logos, icons • Default Button\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:46\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"261\">\n          <text id=\"3:47\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"3:48\" name=\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis of every section • All other colors: neutrals, text, light / dark section backgrounds, surfaces, borders, chart and progress colors, selected filter, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current filter, card hover, expanded / collapsed FAQ, hover • Header with dropdown triggers, stat and chart cards, client wordmark row, video block, filter tags, case-study card, testimonial with pager, FAQ accordion, article card, CTA banner, footer • How image placeholders are sized and placed\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:49\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2963\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"3:50\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:51\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Information hierarchy across sections 4. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 5. Component reuse 6. State design (current filter, card hover, expanded FAQ)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n      <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 1 named frame, your components.\" x=\"0\" y=\"237\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"10b11d48-164f-4347-84eb-762e4fc64f19","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:13:00.242Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3286\">\n    <frame id=\"3:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"3:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"3:5\" name=\"MAC — digital marketing agency landing page\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"3:6\" name=\"Design the landing page of a digital marketing agency: introduce the agency, prove results, show case studies, answer common questions and invite visitors to get in touch. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"3:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"3:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 1 frame below, named exactly as listed. It is a single landing page, so there is no prototype to wire. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the nav