{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNuJ7MkxPemLxDCrwXM6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build the 03 · Workspace page with a 1440-wide frame called \"01_Home\", and to make the header, footer, navigation and business elements as reusable components. I start by setting up the design system so every later step reuses the same values: lime #99EA48, ink #010205, body text #4A4F58, muted #7A808C, border #E6E8EC, surface #F5F7F4, lime tint #EAFBD8, and Plus Jakarta Sans throughout.\n\nThe page is 1440 wide with 1200 of content and 120 side margins. I set the root frame to vertical auto layout so each section stacks cleanly. Sections run in this order: header, hero, trusted brands, about, projects and video, case studies, testimonial, FAQ, blog, CTA, footer.\n\nFor the header at height 88, I put the logo left, centered nav items (Service, Agency, Case Study, Resources, each with a chevron), then Contact, a bell icon in a 44 circle, and the Get started button. In the hero I take the headline \"Stay ahead of the curve with our forward-thinking\" at 64px with -2% letter spacing, an 18px paragraph at width 480, a lime \"Schedule Call\" button with an arrow, and a \"View Case Study\" text link. The right column stacks a dark 520-wide card holding \"230+\" and a progress bar above a white traffic card reading \"Drive More Traffic and Sales\" with a 3-bar chart.\n\nThe trusted strip pairs \"Trusted by the world's biggest brands\" with the Paywise, Campfield and Mazeline wordmarks and dividers. The about block sets \"Provide the best service with out-of-the-box ideas\" at 48px left and the paragraph at 16px, width 520, right. Projects puts \"920+\" at 80px with \"Projects finished superbly\", 4 avatars at 56 each plus a \"+230\" circle, beside a 560x360 dark video block labelled \"HOW WE WORK\" with a play button.\n\nCase studies uses a 384 card grid with 24 gaps, summing to 1200. Filters read All Work 20, UI/UX Design 10 (selected), Digital Marketing 5, Branding 5. The first card sits in hover state with a \"See Details\" pill and no caption; the other two carry \"Ai Corporation. 2023\" above \"Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App\". The testimonial is a full-bleed ink band with the quote at 32px, a 56 avatar, Michael Kaizer, CEO of Campfield Corp, and a 01/05 pager with prev/next circles.\n\nThe FAQ splits 420 and 720: \"Digital Marketing FAQs\" with More Questions and Contact Us buttons, and 4 accordion rows with the first expanded. Blog leads with \"Digital Marketing & SEO Services That Grow Traffic & Increase Revenue\", a right paragraph and \"See more\", then 3 article cards at 384 with a 5 min read label. The CTA is a lime 1200 card holding \"Ready to work with us?\" at 48px and a dark Get Started button. The footer is ink with logo, description, social icons, and Navigation, Licence and Contact columns above a divider.\n\nReusable pieces become components: Button (Primary, Secondary, Inverse, Ghost across Default and Hover), Nav Item, Filter Tag, Case Study Card, Article Card, FAQ Item, Social Button, Avatar, Header and Footer. Each sits at x=1700 so the frame stays clean, and instances get their text and fills overridden in place.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3488,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":32452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3488}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"b6c1b3cb-9cef-4cc1-9267-c29d925b745e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:15:18.394Z","thinking_duration_ms":81561}
