{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNvi85LT3qgewHOedENU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before fixing anything, what I need:\n\n1. **The text-height defect confirmed.** The metadata shows every wrapped text node at height 10 — H1, hero body, about heading, FAQ answer, blog heading. That is my `T()` helper setting auto-height *before* the resize, which froze the frame height. It affects the whole file, components included.\n2. **A global relayout pass** that sets `NONE` → resize width → `HEIGHT` on every text node, so heights recompute from the actual string.\n3. **Container corrections that depend on those new heights**: the hero row, case grid, article grid, FAQ list and the expanded FAQ instance all need hug sizing, and the case card caption needs 404 not 400.\n4. **Re-verification renders** after the fix.\n\nItem 1 is already answered by the metadata (height 10 across the board), so it needs no request. Items 2 and 4 sit on opposite sides of the fix — 4 cannot run until 2 lands. Item 3's exact values depend on 2's output. So the only thing that can go now is item 2, with a measurement report attached so item 3 can be computed from real numbers."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7718,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":157174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7718}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"ae7ee06e-3dda-440e-9e52-927b1f139d87","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:32:07.309Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNvi85LT3qgewHOedENU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016jQoIOqZP465wyK7DbHIl5","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst page=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst fonts=new Set();\nfor (const n of page.findAll(x=>x.type==='TEXT')) fonts.add(JSON.stringify(n.fontName));\nfor (const f of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync(JSON.parse(f));\nlet fixed=0;\nfor (const t of page.findAll(x=>x.type==='TEXT')){\n  const w=t.width;\n  const mode=t.textAutoResize;\n  if(w>0){\n    t.textAutoResize='NONE';\n    t.resize(w,t.height);\n    t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\n    fixed++;\n  } else {\n    t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n    fixed++;\n  }\n}\nconst root=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='01_Home');\nconst key=['H1','Hero body','About heading','About body','Case studies heading','FAQ heading','Blog heading','Answer','Question','Title','Excerpt','Quote','Headline'];\nconst report=[];\nfor (const t of root.findAll(x=>x.type==='TEXT')){\n  if(key.indexOf(t.name)>-1) report.push({name:t.name,h:Math.round(t.height),w:Math.round(t.width),y:Math.round(t.absoluteBoundingBox.y)});\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify({fixed,report:report.slice(0,24)});\n","description":"Force all text nodes to recompute auto height","fileKey":"N5enrxo4N7aBzKhkTSXpzU"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7718,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":157174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7718}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"b4c1092d-c53e-407b-a11d-c9a1dd7bc645","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:32:07.399Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016jQoIOqZP465wyK7DbHIl5","display_name":"Use 