{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNvr2vBz5mqPw9CsFzdA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I need next:\n\n1. **A type-guarded rewrite.** The last attempt died because `findAll` by name matched *text* nodes too — `Caption` exists both as a frame and as a text string — so a layout property was set on a TEXT node. Fixing it needs `type === 'FRAME'` filters before any auto-layout call.\n2. **A re-audit** of the two known overflows after that guard.\n3. **Section-level renders** at readable width, plus a component-board render of the reflowed masters.\n4. **A final inventory** of section heights, so the delivered frame height matches real content rather than a stale pin.\n\nItems 3 and 4 read nodes the guarded write is about to modify, so running them now would capture a superseded state and waste the calls. Sending item 1 with its audit; the renders follow once it lands."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1966,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":173533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1966}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"70576f5c-2adc-49b1-89ba-60864fe58e60","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:33:41.427Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNvr2vBz5mqPw9CsFzdA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01tt6t9cPYIkMSfsoykwvbyo","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst page=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const f of [{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'},{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'},{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'},{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Bold'},{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'ExtraBold'}]) await figma.loadFontAsync(f);\nconst root=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='01_Home');\nconst board=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Component library · MAC');\nconst hugFrame=n=>{ if(n&&n.type==='FRAME'&&n.layoutMode&&n.layoutMode!=='NONE') n.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; };\nconst card=board.findOne(n=>n.name==='Case Study Card'&&n.type==='COMPONENT_SET');\nif(card) card.children.forEach(v=>{\n  v.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='Caption').forEach(hugFrame);\n  v.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n});\nroot.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='Caption').forEach(hugFrame);\nroot.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='FAQ intro').forEach(hugFrame);\nroot.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='FAQ row').forEach(hugFrame);\nroot.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='Case grid').forEach(hugFrame);\nroot.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('FAQ ')===0).forEach(i=>{ i.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; });\nroot.children.forEach(c=>{ if(c.type==='FRAME') c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; });\nconst issues=[];\nfunction walk(n,path){\n  if(n.layoutMode&&n.layoutMode!=='NONE'&&n.primaryAxisSizingMode==='FIXED'){\n    const ch=n.children;\n    const sum=(n.layoutMode==='VERTICAL'?n.paddingTop+n.paddingBottom:n.paddingLeft+n.paddingRight)+ch.reduce((a,c)=>a+c.height,0)+Math.max(0,ch.length-1)*n.itemSpacing;\n    const avail=n.layoutMode==='VERTICAL'?n.height:n.width;\n    if(sum>avail+1) issues.push({node:n.name,path:path.slice(-3).join('/'),need:Math.round(sum),have:Math.round(avail)});\n  }\n  if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,path.concat(n.name)));\n}\nwalk(root,[]);\nreturn JSON.stringify({rootH:Math.round(root.height),count:issues.length,issues:issues.slice(0,12),sections:root.children.map(c=>c.name+' h'+Math.round(c.height))});\n","description":"Hug caption and FAQ intro frames, re-audit page","fileKey":"N5enrxo4N7aBzKhkTSXpzU"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1966,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":173533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1966}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"13da5f6c-d229-4e12-b145-867c4375286f","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:33:45.630Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01tt6t9cPYIkMSfsoykwvbyo","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
