t":"The screenshot is included inline as a base64-encoded PNG in the image content entry above (mimeType: image/png).\nIt is also hosted at the URL in the first content entry (as JSON). To download a copy:\n\n  curl -f -L -o screenshot.png \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/0c22b785-8070-4585-8c33-f1f5e1b6f20b.png\"\n\nThe URL returns raw PNG bytes (Content-Type: image/png). The URL is short-lived — treat it like a secret."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"7e201858-63c1-433a-8d57-c50dfbefa00a"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Vtpc9SLQkVxXEC4t2RbPNJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNw5VmomBfEGkcPNWPox","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01yeYCRzpJvcBHAjIdRfZVS7","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst page=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst root=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='01_Home');\nconst texts=root.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT').map(t=>t.characters);\nconst joined=texts.join(' | ');\nconst must=[\n 'Stay ahead of the curve with our forward-thinking',\n 'An award-winning SEO agency with disciplines in digital marketing, design, and website development, focused on understanding you.',\n 'Schedule Call','View Case Study','230+','some big companies that we work with, and trust us very much',\n 'Drive More Traffic and Sales','Drive more traffic and product sales',\n '920+','Projects finished superbly','HOW WE WORK',\n 'Trusted by the world’s biggest brands','Paywise','Campfield','Mazeline',\n 'Provide the best service with out-of-the-box ideas',\n 'We are a passionate team of digital marketing enthusiasts dedicated to helping businesses succeed in the digital world. With years of experience and a deep understanding of the ever-evolving online landscape, we stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies.',\n 'Real-world examples of how we have helped companies achieve their marketing objectives.',\n 'All Work','UI/UX Design','Digital Marketing','Branding',\n 'Ai Corporation. 2023','Ai Wave - Ai Chatbot Mobile App','Lancer Corporation. 2023','App Lancer - Freelance Mobile App','See Details',\n 'They thoroughly analyze our industry and target audience, allowing them to develop customized campaigns that effectively reach and engage our customers. Their creative ideas and cutting-edge techniques have helped us stay ahead of the competition.',\n 'Michael Kaizer','CEO of Campfield Corp','01/05',\n 'Digital Marketing FAQs',\n 'As a leading digital marketing agency, we are dedicated to providing comprehensive educational resources and answering frequently asked questions to help our clients.',\n 'More Questions','Contact Us',\n 'Why is digital marketing important for my business?',\n 'Digital marketing allows businesses to reach and engage with a wider audience, generate leads, drive website traffic, and increase brand visibility. It provides measurable results, allows for targeted marketing efforts, and enables businesses to adapt and optimize their strategies based on data and insights.',\n 'How can digital marketing help improve my website’s visibility?',\n 'How long does it take to see results from digital marketing efforts?',\n 'How do you measure the success of digital marketing campaigns?',\n 'Digital Marketing & SEO Services That Grow Traffic & Increase Revenue',\n 'We are the top digital marketing agency for branding corp. We offer a full range of services to help clients improve their search engine rankings and drive more traffic to their websites.',\n 'See more','5 min read',\n 'How a Digital Marketing Agency Can Boost Your Business',\n 'The Latest Trends and Strategies with a Digital Marketing Agency',\n 'Maximizing ROI with the Expertise of a Digital Marketing Agency',\n 'Ready to work with us?','Get Started','Get started',\n 'We offer a comprehensive suite of digital marketing services that cover all aspects of your online presence. From SEO and social media marketing to content creation and PPC advertising, we have the expertise and resources to handle your diverse marketing needs.',\n 'Privacy Policy','Copyright','Email Address','(406) 555-0120','hey@example.com','2972 Westheimer Rd. Santa Ana, Illinois 85486',\n 'Service','Agency','Case Study','Resources','Contact'\n];\nconst missing=must.filter(m=>joined.indexOf(m)<0);\nreturn JSON.stringify({missing:missing,total:texts.length});\n","description":"Audit built page copy against brief strings","fileKey":"N5enrxo4N7aBzKhkTSXpzU"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3028,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":177721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3028}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edda5e9e-0ec5-4b39-b67c-ee53c7205928","uuid":"9abc5dc8-8099-4e22-b74b-625d5e8f7368","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:36:55.324Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01yeYCRzpJvcBHAjIdRfZVS7","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
